  "purpose": "<p>The European Scrutiny Committee operated until 2024. The committee assessed the legal and/or political importance of EU documents deposited by the Government in Parliament.</p>\r\n<p>Information on the Committee’s work and publications are available on this website. The Committee’s email address is no longer being monitored. For general queries email <a href=\"mailto:hcenquiries@parliament.uk\">hcenquiries@parliament.uk</a>.</p>",
